		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Black tarry sludge that makes the air thin and hard to breathe. Mountain pass lurker, enjoys slow killing.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tentacle +6 (1d10) or tremors, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Hypoxic</strong>. Causes thin air in domain. CON 9+ each hour or 1 CON damage, passing out at 0 CON, death afterwards.</p><p></p><p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Acid immune.</p><p></p><p><strong>Tremors</strong>. All creatures within far, DEX 15+ or fall prone. Can trigger avalanches.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
